        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\nMOST UNIQUE 2 STOREY 3 / 4 BED 1 BATH COTTAGE\r\nLARGE SITE OF APPROX 1 ACRE WITH POTENTIAL FOR ANOTHER PROPERTY SUBJECT TO PLANNING\r\nMOST IDYLLIC SETTING YET ONLY MINUTES FROM THE M4 MOTORWAY\r\nEASY COMMUTE TO DUBLIN\r\nMULLINGAR & KINNEGAD ARE WITHIN CLOSE PROXIMITY\r\n\r\nA most captivating home in an idyllic setting....\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Leinster Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this lovely home to the Westmeath Property Market.\r\n\r\nThis lovely cottage oozes charm and charisma and is in good condition however its new owners can put their own unique stamp on it creating their forever home.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan consists of: Entrance hallway, living room, bedroom / sitting room, kitchen / dining room, utility room and downstairs bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe first floor consists of a landing and 3 bedrooms.\r\n\r\nOutside the property has large grounds with unlimited development potential subject to planning.\r\n\r\nThe property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families.\r\n\r\nThis is country living at its best, with bustling towns on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThe general area is serviced by an excellent bus route and train service.\r\n\r\nThe M4 Motorway is close by connecting all surrounding areas and Dublin is within a leisurely commute.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
